VALUES ('Quizartinib', 'Quizartinib was progressed through clinical trials to determine efficacy in acute myeloid leukemia (AML), including newly diagnosed FLT3-ITD +ve AML. Phase 2 and phase 3 results were published in 2019 . First approval was granted by the Japanese Ministry of Health, Labor and Welfare (MHLW) in June 2019, for use of quizartinib in therapy regimens for FLT3-ITD +ve AML. US FDA approval for this indication was issued in July 2023, followed by EU EMA approval in November 2023, for the treatment of newly diagnosed FLT3-ITD +ve AML .', NULL)
