INSERT INTO public.generic_medicines (generic_name, description, atc_code)
VALUES ('Trametinib', 'Used to treat BRAF V600 mutation positive metastatic melanomas. In April 2018, the FDA approved the use of in combination with trametinib for the adjuvant treatment of patients with BRAF V600E or V600K mutated melanoma (as detected by an FDA-approved test) and involvement of lymph node(s), following complete resection. Then in May, this same combination was approved (FDA) for the treatment of locally advanced/metastatic BRAF V600E +ve anaplastic thyroid cancer. The EMA issued orphan drug designation for the use of trametinib with dabrafenib in the treatment of low- and high-grade gliomas with a BRAF V600E mutations, in January 2024.', NULL)
