VALUES ('Hydrocodone', 'Used to treat severe pain, and as a cough suppressant. In November 2014 an extended release formulation, Hysingla ER, was approved by the US FDA. Hysingla ER contains hydrocodone bitartrate (PubChem ) and is intended for use only where alternative treatment options are ineffective, not tolerated or do not provide adequate pain management. The formulation of Hysingla ER is designed to make it very difficult to be crushed, broken up or dissolved, with the aim of severely limiting its appeal as a substance of prescription opioid abuse via nasal inhalation or injection.', NULL)
