VALUES ('Apremilast', 'Apremilast is approved to treat psoriatic arthritis (PsA). This drug is also in clinical trial as a potential treatment for several other inflammatory conditions. View a list of these trials at . In the US and EU, apremilast has been granted orphan desigantion for the treatment of , an auto-immune disease which damages blood vessels and causes sores on mucosal membranes and occular and vascular inflammation. In September 2014, the US FDA granted approval for the treatment of patients with moderate to severe plaque psoriasis, making Otezla® the first and only PDE4 inhibitor available for this indication.', NULL)
