VALUES ('Tezepelumab', 'Evauation of tezepelumab was continued in patients with severe asthma, but it failed to demonstrate efficacy in atopic dermatitis . Tezepelumab was granted breakthrough designation by the FDA in September 2018 based on data from the Phase 2b PATHWAY study. Click to link to ClinicalTrials.gov''s full listing of tezepelumab (research coded AMG 157 or MEDI9929) trials. The FDA granted full approval as a therapeutic option for severe asthma in December 2021.', NULL)
