VALUES ('Delgocitinib', 'The developer''s (Japan Tobacco Inc.) pipeline update in May 2017 listed JTE-052 as being in Phase 2 clinical development. In January 2020 topical delgocitinib was approved in Japan, for the treatment of atopic dermatitis , with Phase 3 results being published by Nakagawa et al. 3 months later . In Europe the EMA approved delgocitinib (Anzupgo®) as a treatment for moderate/severe chronic hand eczema in September 2024, with FDA approval for this indication following in July 2025.', NULL)
