INSERT INTO public.generic_medicines (generic_name, description, atc_code)
VALUES ('Rilzabrutinib', 'Rilzabrutinib (PRN1008) was advanced to clinical trials. Phase 1 results from healthy volunteers showed that orally administered PRN1008 was safe and well-tolerated , and that high and sustained levels of BTK occupancy were achieved in peripheral blood mononuclear cells . More advanced studies include phase 3 evaluation in subjects with pemphigus vulgaris (), and a Phase 1/2 study in patients with immune thrombocytopenic purpura (ITP) (). Principia Biopharma modified the NCT03395210 protocol to add a long-term extension cohort for responders, and to facilitate the potential enrollment of additional patients to aid design of the Phase 3 study. First FDA approval was granted in August 2025 , to treat persistent/chronic, treatment-resistant ITP.', NULL)
